{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10231070","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10231070","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1023107001:1":{"text":"やあ、誰かがケンカしてるって聞いたけど。いったい何があったんだ？","source_cn":"嗨，听你们在说有人吵架，具体是什么情况？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93DF1E2FBD6CBA6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1023107002:1":{"text":"いつものことだよ。北村の貧乏な若造のために、ロリエットとおやじさんがしょっちゅうケンカしてるんだ。最近は特に酷くてね……","source_cn":"唉，我们已经司空见惯了。为了北村的那个穷小子，罗丽叶和...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9804E7EE5963D28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1023107003:1":{"text":"ロリエットさんとお父さんの間に意見の食い違いがあるようですね。なぜか分かりますか？","source_cn":"听起来这位罗丽叶小姐和她父亲有些意见不合，他们为什么要吵架？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x272F6A5AE8158FAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1023107004:1":{"text":"ロリエットは北村のジュミオとの関係を認めてほしいのよ。でもお父さんのジャルダンが絶対にダメだって……","source_cn":"这个罗丽叶，非要和北村的朱密欧在一起，可她父亲贾尔丹坚...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5DC55C4260594682","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1023107005:1":{"text":"そのせいでロリエットは毎日家で大暴れ。彼女がジュミオに会いに行くのを阻止するために、ジャルダンは家の扉まで塞いだんだから！","source_cn":"小姑娘整天在家里搞得像要死要活的。为了阻止她去见那个男...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD221934FBF5F3251","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1023107006:1":{"text":"家から出られないのでは……ジュミオさんが彼女に会えないのも仕方ないですね。","source_cn":"难怪朱密欧说见不到罗丽叶……原来她根本走不出家门。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C78CA2C53310376","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1023107007:1":{"text":"ジャルダンもむごいよなぁ、ロリエットはもう何日もご飯を食べてないんだって。\n俺だったら自分の娘に絶食なんてさせられないね。","source_cn":"要说这贾尔丹也真够狠的，罗丽叶都绝食好几天了。\\n换做...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13F99EFE73650642","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1023107007":{"text":"ジャルダンもむごいよなぁ、ロリエットはもう何日もご飯を食べてないんだって。\n俺だったら自分の娘に絶食なんてさせられないね。","source_cn":"要说这贾尔丹也真够狠的，罗丽叶都绝食好几天了。\\n换做是我，我可舍不得让自己女儿饿肚子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13F99EFE73650642","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1023107008:3":{"text":"そのロリエットの家はどこにあるんだ？","source_cn":"这位罗丽叶小姐的家在哪儿？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A6AFF2FD69E678A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1023107009:1":{"text":"ここから北西に向かって、柵で囲まれた家がそうよ。","source_cn":"喏，从这里往西北面走，看见那家围满栅栏的就是了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9340DFDC9D41CAF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_